<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <title>Mathematical Base Defenders — A multiplayer mental math game.</title>
  <%- include("../partials/head.ejs") %>
  <%- include("../partials/slide-down.ejs") %>
  <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/css/index.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200" />
</head>

<body>
  <main>
    <%- include("../partials/header.ejs") %>
    <div id="header">
      <div id="header__content" class="content">
      <h1>Welcome (back) to Mathematical Base Defenders!</h1>
      <hr>
      Mathematical Base Defenders is a mental math game where you solve math problems to kill enemies, and that's pretty much it.
      It's easy to get to know the rules, but hard to master! With both easy and hard modes, as well as singleplayer and multiplayer modes,
      there's sure to be something that suits you or your group's need for mental math games!
      <br>
      </div>
      <div id="header__call-to-action">
        <div id="header__call-to-action__left">
          <div class="preview" id="video-preview__container__container">
            <div id="video-preview__container">
              <video id="video-preview" class="preview__video" muted="" autoplay="" loop="" style="pointer-events: none;">
                It seems like your browser doesn't support embedded videos.
                <br>Here's a <a href="/assets/videos/mathematicalbasedefenders.com-preview.mp4">link to the gameplay preview</a> instead.
                <source src="/assets/videos/mathematicalbasedefenders.com-preview.mp4" type="video/mp4">
              </video>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="header__call-to-action__right">
          <button class="button--call-to-action button--play">
            Play Now!
          </button>
          <br>
          <a href="/register">...or register for an account</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="information">
      <div class="content">
        <h2>Multiple gamemodes to choose from!</h2>
        <hr>
        <div class="data">
          <div class="data__left">
            Mathematical Base Defenders has a variety of modes to choose from, including:
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Standard Singleplayer</strong>: The standard mode, with fast enemies and expanding problem bounds.</li>
              <li><strong>Easy Singleplayer</strong>: Slower enemies and constant problem bounds.</li>
              <li><strong>Custom Singleplayer</strong>: Make your own rules and play by it, if Standard Singleplayer wasn't enough!</li>
              <li><strong>Multiplayer</strong>: Jump in to the default room with default settings, or make your own rules and have everyone play by it!</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="data__right">
            <img src="/assets/images/standard-frontpage-preview.png" alt="A game of Mathematical Base Defenders in Standard Singleplayer mode.">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <h2>Multiple customization options to choose from!</h2>
        <hr>
        <div class="data">
          <div class="data__left">
            Mathematical Base Defenders has a variety of customization settings to choose from, including:
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Metric Display</strong>: Three levels of metric display preciseness, choose the one that suits you!</li>
              <li><strong>Enemy Color Palette</strong>: Want all the enemies to have the same color or to follow a palette? Just set it! Don't care? There's also an option for a random color for each enemy!</li>
              <li><strong>Background Images</strong>: Don't like the black background? Choose a background image yourself!</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="data__right">
            <img src="/assets/images/stat-display-frontpage.png" alt="A game of Mathematical Base Defenders in Standard Singleplayer mode.">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <h2>A variety of other features to spice up your gameplay!</h2>
        <hr>
        <div class="data">
          <div class="data__left">
            Many other supplementary features are available, including but not limited to:
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Accounts</strong>: Register for an account to track your scores, and maybe you'll get a colored name?</li>
              <li><strong>Leaderboards</strong>: Compare your scores with everyone else! Special profile decorations available for the Top 100 as well!</li> 
              <li><strong>Replays</strong>: See how the top players do it through a dedicated replay system! Or maybe just forgot to hit record? It's available for every registered account!</li> 
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="data__right"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="call-to-action">
      <div id="call-to-action__content">
        <div id="call-to-action__message">
          <div>
            <h1>Ready to play?</h1>
          </div>
          <div id="call-to-action__button">
            <a href="https://play.mathematicalbasedefenders.com">
              <button class="button--call-to-action button--play">
                <span>Play</span>
              </button>
            </a>
            <a class="text-align--right" href="/register">...or register for an account</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <%- include("../partials/footer.ejs") %>
</body>
</html>
